# Learning Summary

## Overview

This project provided practical experience in Security Operations Center (SOC) workflows, threat detection, vulnerability management, and incident investigation using open-source security tools.

The focus was on understanding how attackers operate and how defenders can detect and respond to suspiciouas activity.

